[11:09:35] [INFO] 
[11:09:35] [INFO] 1. Uses measured Newtonian slope Γ_N = 0.7476777251184834 (from CMC simulations)
[11:09:35] [INFO] 2. Applies the TEP framework's scaling assumption: potential vs acceleration
